ion":null,"city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,86,1,3,40,78],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14001","armor":"WP1000305","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,86,1,3,40,78],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14001","armor":"WP1000305","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,86,1,3,40,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14001","armor":"WP1000305","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10120","city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,86,1,3,40,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP14001","armor":"WP1000305","helmet":"WP1019405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"南蛮一代的乌戈国国主，身长丈二，不食五谷，以生蛇恶兽为饭，身有鳞甲，刀箭不入。诸葛亮平定南蛮的末期，兀突骨响应孟获的求援，率领麾下著名的藤甲兵击退蜀军，但因中了诸葛亮的佯败之计，而遭魏延火攻，导致全军覆灭，因此使孟获第七次被诸葛亮所擒。","tc":"南蠻一代的烏戈國國主，身長丈二，不食五谷，以生蛇惡獸為飯，身有鱗甲，刀箭不入。諸葛亮平定南蠻的末期，兀突骨響應孟獲的求援，率領麾下著名的藤甲兵擊退蜀軍，但因中了諸葛亮的佯敗之計，而遭魏延火攻，導致全軍覆滅，因此使孟獲第七次被諸葛亮所擒。","en":"King of the Wuge Kingdom in the Nanman region. He stood twelve chi tall, ate no grain but subsisted on raw snakes and ferocious beasts, and his body bore scales that turned aside blades and arrows. Near the end of Zhuge Liang's pacification of the Nanman, Wutugu answered Meng Huo's plea for aid and led his famous rattan-armored troops to rout the Shu army. However, falling for Zhuge Liang's feigned retreat, he was struck by Wei Yan's fire attack, resulting in the annihilation of his entire army and leading to Meng Huo being captured by Zhuge Liang for the seventh time.","jp":"南蛮一帯にある烏戈国の国主。身長は丈二、五穀を食さず、生きた蛇や猛獣を糧とし、身には鱗甲を帯びて刀や矢を通さなかった。諸葛亮の南蛮平定の末期、兀突骨は孟獲の救援要請に応じて名高い藤甲兵を率い、蜀軍を撃退した。しかし諸葛亮の偽りの敗走の計に嵌まり、魏延の火攻めに遭って全軍壊滅。これにより孟獲は諸葛亮に七度目の捕縛をされることとなった。","kr":"남만 일대의 오과국 국주로, 신장이 1장 2척에 달하고 오곡을 먹지 않으며 날뱀과 맹수를 주식으로 삼았다. 몸에 비늘이 돋아 있어 도와 화살도 뚫지 못했다. 제갈량이 남만을 평정하던 말기, 올돌골은 맹획의 구원 요청에 응하여 휘하의 유명한 등갑병을 이끌고 촉군을 격퇴했으나, 제갈량의 거짓 패퇴 계책에 넘어가 위연의 화공을 받고 전군이 궤멸당했다. 이로 인해 맹획은 제갈량에게 일곱 번째로 사로잡히게 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10216","remark":"","surname":"兀","surnameTc":"兀","surnameEn":"Wu","surnameJp":"兀","surnameKr":"올","surnameOther":"","name":"突骨","nameTc":"突骨","nameEn":"Tugu","nameJp":"突骨","nameKr":"돌골","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"兀突骨","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1044","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"86","wise":"1","politics":"3","charm":"40","will":"78","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"1","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"10","weaponMaster":"37/89/37/37/37/0/50/37","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1002102;1000202","battleSkill":"1007705;1010402","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1006505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6200","battleSoulPoint":"8000","debateSoulPoint":"0","strategy":"1002401;1005315","strategy2":"1004001","professions":"4/3/0/2/0/0/3/0/0/0/1/1/3/0/1/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/5","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"34","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1550","evaluate":"-5000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"186","show":"211","death":"225","age":"